  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用 KubeJS<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" rel=\"nofollow\">[link]</a> 创建自定义的 Create<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">[link]</a> Ponder 场景。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">请阅读 GitHub Wiki 查找示例，或加入我们的 Discord 获取帮助。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组是 PonderJS<a href=\"https://github.com/Create-Additions/Ponderjs\" rel=\"nofollow\">[link]</a> 针对 <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>1.18.2+</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"> 的延续版本。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">对于较旧的版本，请参阅原始项目<a href=\"https://github.com/Create-Additions/Ponderjs\" rel=\"nofollow\">[link]</a>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>鸣谢</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kotakotik22/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">kotakotik22</a>&nbsp;：原始项目作者</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 团队：Ponder 系统开发者</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>链接</strong></span><br><a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/ponderjs/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Wiki</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/ponderjs\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Readme 页面</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fThFnwZCyYY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
